{
  "name": "Second Brain – Telegram Bot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🧠 Second Brain — Telegram Bot\n\nn8n hanya **relay tipis**: parsing perintah, NLP tanggal, AI capture/summary, pembuatan task/note/inbox, dan tombol inline semuanya ada di web app (`POST /api/public/n8n/bot`). n8n menambah 2 kemampuan berbasis file: **OCR** (foto/gambar/PDF → OpenAI vision) dan **transkripsi** (voice → OpenAI audio).\n\n**Env n8n:** `SECOND_BRAIN_URL`, `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`, `TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CHAT_IDS`, `OPENAI_VISION_MODEL` (opsional), `OPENAI_TRANSCRIBE_MODEL` (opsional) + `N8N_BLOCK_ENV_ACCESS_IN_NODE=false`\n**Credentials:** Telegram API (trigger), Header Auth `x-api-key` = `N8N_API_KEY` web app, OpenAI API. Ganti semua `REPLACE_ME`.\n\n⚠️ Satu bot = satu webhook. Mengaktifkan workflow ini menimpa webhook bawaan app (`/api/public/telegram/webhook`). Lihat README → *Mode bot*.\n🔒 Chat di luar allow-list diabaikan diam-diam. Eksekusi sukses tidak disimpan (privasi).",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 820,
        "color": "6"
      },
      "id": "b39aa2e0-532b-4a63-b099-91f1e691eb25",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
